2. List 3 product companies and 3 service companies with one example of work each does.

        Company         Example of Work                                                                          
        -------------   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
        Google          Develops products such as Google Search, Gmail, Google Maps, and Android.                
        Microsoft       Develops products such as Windows, Microsoft 365, Azure, and Visual Studio.              
        Zoho            Develops business software such as CRM, accounting, and project management applications. 

        Company                              Example of Work                                                                               
       ----------------------------------   --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
        TCS (Tata Consultancy Services)     Provides software development, IT consulting, and digital transformation services to clients. 
        Infosys                             Provides IT consulting, software development, and technology services to businesses.          
        Wipro                               Provides IT services, consulting, cloud, cybersecurity, and digital transformation solutions. 

        Simple difference:
        A product company mainly develops and sells its own software or technology products,
        while a service company mainly provides IT services and solutions to clients.
